#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:3
#: 9a028457a3b14e9bb2ad5ddfee70beae
msgid "晶格应变（Lattice Strain）"
msgstr "Lattice Strain"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:5
#: a0e22c76bdb9433592af9bb697631d64
msgid "**分类：** 晶格"
msgstr "**Category:** Lattice"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:7
#: f48d5d2b7c7f4e5cbee283fb8bf24c12
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:9
#: f2c59d1797024371817e1cb0b18a3409
msgid ""
"对晶胞轴向做受控应变扫描。选定方向组合（单轴/双轴/三轴/各向同性），给定拉伸百"
"分比和步长，程序按比例缩放晶格矢量，生成一组不同应变的结构。"
msgstr ""
"Scan controlled axial strains of the cell. Choose a uniaxial, biaxial, "
"triaxial, or isotropic mode and provide percentage ranges and steps; the "
"card scales lattice vectors to generate the requested strain states."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:11
#: f04745e8b01a42bcb8d998668181e2ce
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principle and equations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:13
#: ccd18e4c1901458fb51dd066bc8dae27
msgid ""
"\\epsilon_i=\\frac{s_i}{100},\\quad \\mathbf{C}'=\\mathbf{D}\\mathbf{C},"
"\\quad \\mathbf{D}=\\mathrm{diag}(1+\\epsilon_x,1+\\epsilon_y,1+\\epsilon_z)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:15
#: 089c190cd96248c58c0c709b62efb693
msgid ""
"其中 $s_i$ 是界面输入的百分数，$\\epsilon_i$ 是无量纲工程应变，$\\mathbf C$ "
"是原晶胞 矩阵。未选中的方向取 $\\epsilon_i=0$。原子分数坐标保持不变，所以生成"
"的是晶胞和原子 共同经历的仿射应变。"
msgstr "Here $s_i$ is the percentage entered in the UI, $\\epsilon_i$ is the dimensionless engineering strain, and $\\mathbf C$ is the original cell matrix. Unselected directions use $\\epsilon_i=0$. Atomic fractional coordinates remain unchanged, so the cell and atoms undergo the same affine strain."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:19
#: ca0d9dcedb64423780a6b5f9b92a693f
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:21
#: 9169288f5da54c8dbbee3bae45f1cad5
msgid "场景：模型预测的弹性常数偏差太大"
msgstr "Scenario: Predicted elastic constants have a large bias"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:23
#: 6742ab397b2e46908a33998aa90fbf36
msgid ""
"你在 Si 上训练了一个 NEP 模型，能量-体积曲线拟合得很好，但算出来的 C11 比 "
"DFT 参考值高了 15%。这说明训练集里所有结构都处在平衡体积附近，模型没见过晶格"
"被拉伸/压缩的构型，只能外推——外推不准。"
msgstr ""
"A Si NEP reproduces the energy-volume curve but predicts C11 15% above the "
"DFT reference. The training set is concentrated near equilibrium and does "
"not show the model explicit tensile and compressive states, so the elastic "
"derivative relies on extrapolation."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:25
#: d3a37e92f73f4e3f8466dd7a990e967e
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 弹性常数是能量对应变的二阶导数。如果训练集在平衡点附近的应变成"
"分太稀疏，导数拟合就不可靠。解决办法是往训练集里加入一组已知应变的晶格，让模"
"型\"见过\"被拉伸和压缩的晶胞。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** Elastic constants are second derivatives of energy with "
"respect to strain. Sparse strain sampling around equilibrium makes these "
"derivatives unreliable. Add cells with known tensile and compressive strains "
"so the model interpolates locally."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:27
#: 6e32de913e7148568c53482aa6966f1c
msgid "**输入：** 一个弛豫好的 Si 单胞（当前训练集里唯一的结构）"
msgstr ""
"**Input:** A relaxed Si unit cell, currently the only structure in the "
"training set."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:29
#: 2ddfe83537dc4f7ca8211ee1853c08e1
msgid ""
"**目标：** 沿 x 方向做 -2% 到 +2% 的单轴应变，步长 1%，共 5 个结构，让模型在 "
"±2% 范围内有内插依据"
msgstr ""
"**Objective:** Apply uniaxial x strains from -2% to +2% in 1% steps, "
"producing five structures for interpolation within that range."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:31
#: 9335df4ff87e4fd1870b3a871e6be23d
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:32
#: c46002b2daab45a8804e839bf5272059
msgid "`轴`（`axes`） = `uniaxial`"
msgstr "`Axes` (`axes`) = `uniaxial`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:33
#: de4dbd292f8a4d3b9ea7be74a2cc7ec7
msgid "`X 轴范围`（`x_range`） = `[-2, 2, 1]` （-2% 到 +2%，每 1% 一步）"
msgstr "`X-axis range` (`x_range`) = `[-2, 2, 1]` (-2% to +2%, in 1% steps)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:35
#: 5ef85c72020c4dc4b6320b4af9663549
msgid ""
"**输出：** 5 个结构（-2%, -1%, 0%, +1%, +2%），晶格 x 分量逐步拉长，原子分数"
"坐标保持不变"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** Five structures (-2%, -1%, 0%, +1%, +2%) with progressively "
"scaled x lattice vectors and fixed fractional coordinates."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:37
#: 7436abdc1a594db1805b343a273f7ca2
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:38
#: 45389096f51d4ced9e63a98a413bbb8b
msgid "重训后重新计算 C11，应该比之前更接近 DFT 参考值"
msgstr "Retrain and recompute C11; it should move closer to the DFT reference."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:39
#: 8bff20018f0c46fa9d6008b99fd3c2c1
msgid "如果改善不够，把范围扩大到 ±5%，加 biaxial 方向，增加采样密度"
msgstr ""
"If improvement is insufficient, extend the range toward ±5%, add biaxial "
"states, or increase sampling density."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:40
#: 56812dbcd97f4ad9be9086d25c4dd80c
msgid ""
"如果应变 +5% 后最近邻键长超过物理合理区间（和 DFT 参考键长差 > 0.2Å），说明到"
"了非物理变形区，上限回调"
msgstr ""
"If +5% strain moves the nearest-neighbor distance more than 0.2 Å beyond the "
"DFT reference, treat the deformation as suspect and reduce the upper bound."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:42
#: b97e98cd4b584a718a92b283e0391c23
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:44
#: 8b650847eeda438f9e3072e5a255b4d3
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:45
#: 2aa0808e19dd40cab57348df6b63a7c2
msgid "模型弹性常数、体模量、应力-应变响应系统性偏差大"
msgstr ""
"Elastic constants, bulk modulus, or stress-strain response show systematic "
"bias"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:46
#: f2e617a6b0784e35a084fd8eda2b7272
msgid "训练集中所有结构体积/形状过于集中在平衡态附近"
msgstr ""
"Training-set cell volumes and shapes are concentrated too tightly around "
"equilibrium"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:47
#: d62868d834c84572a90d1ab5e4f2d17b
msgid "需要模型在变形路径上有内插能力而非外推"
msgstr ""
"The model should interpolate rather than extrapolate along a deformation path"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:49
#: e38de61fe92b43f0be0f2d324ebfbd96
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:50
#: b701c09eabaa4e05853c8764c90005a8
msgid "只需要局部原子坐标噪声（用 `Atomic Perturb` 更合适）"
msgstr "Only local coordinate noise is needed; use `Atomic Perturb` instead"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:51
#: 3c2616fe67fa48f38d96245984bb768e
msgid "体系本身对应变不敏感（如刚性分子晶体），加了只是增大训练集体积没帮助"
msgstr ""
"The target system is insensitive to this strain and the added structures "
"would only inflate the dataset"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:53
#: ecd409527b174bff80d99a5d9bbf21bd
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:54
#: 0da56c67847d48349499d3f693c11b6e
msgid "轴（axes）"
msgstr "axes"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:56
#: 36c69286e6d2451197dfc59b4846ba3f
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'uniaxial'`。选 `uniaxial` 就只沿一个方向拉/压，补 C11/C22/C33 "
"这类单轴弹性响应；`biaxial` 同时动两个方向，面内耦合和泊松效应都能覆盖；"
"`isotropic` 三个方向等比例缩放，更接近 EOS 和体模量采样。注意，别在只想做体积"
"曲线的时候打开三轴独立扫描（`triaxial`）——那会触发热爆炸级的组合数。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `'uniaxial'`. `uniaxial` strains one direction for responses "
"such as C11/C22/C33; `biaxial` strains two directions to sample in-plane "
"coupling and Poisson response; `isotropic` scales all axes equally for EOS "
"or bulk-modulus sampling. Do not choose independent `triaxial` scans for a "
"simple volume curve: the Cartesian product can become enormous."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:58
#: 7a6b9d84ce224f67ada487665c2243fb
msgid "X 轴范围（x_range）"
msgstr "x_range"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:60
#: aa829b4e7d6748f08477f617fc4487c8
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(-5.0, 5.0, 1.0)`。格式是 `[最小值, 最大"
"值, 步长]`，单位 %。只有 `轴`（`axes`）激活的方向才生效；isotropic 模式只认 "
"x_range。步长越小、范围越宽，输出的结构就越多。"
msgstr "`tuple[float, float, float]`, default `(-5.0, 5.0, 1.0)`. Format: `[minimum, maximum, step]`, in %. Only directions activated by `Axes` (`axes`) take effect; isotropic mode uses only `x_range`. Smaller steps and wider ranges produce more structures."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:62
#: 13fdb3d3ca4c43369758aabe9a874ad2
msgid ""
"典型参考值：±1~2% 是大多数无机晶体的弹性区，键长变化一般不到 0.1 Å，补弹性常"
"数首选这个区间。推到 ±3~5% 就进入非谐区了，适合做应力-应变曲线覆盖，抽检输出"
"确认没有非物理键长。如果你设到 ±6% 以上，那是极端变形，很可能拉断键——每批跑完"
"务必抽查最近邻距离。"
msgstr ""
"As a starting point, ±1-2% is the elastic regime for many inorganic crystals "
"and usually changes bond lengths by less than 0.1 Å. ±3-5% enters a more "
"anharmonic regime suitable for stress-strain coverage. Above ±6% is extreme; "
"inspect nearest-neighbor distances in every batch."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:64
#: 8bb8d46f5569433c903e5fbd97b8fa06
msgid "Y 轴范围（y_range）"
msgstr "y_range"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:66
#: d6c6106e753f40ff9f22c69eef23aaaa
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(-5.0, 5.0, 1.0)`。语法和 x_range 完全一"
"样，仅作用在 y 轴。只有 `轴`（`axes`）激活的方向才生效。isotropic 模式不单独"
"看 y_range。典型参考值和 x_range 一致：±1~2% 弹性区，±3~5% 非谐区，±6%+ 需要"
"警惕非物理键长。"
msgstr "`tuple[float, float, float]`, default `(-5.0, 5.0, 1.0)`. The syntax is the same as `x_range` and applies only to the y axis. It takes effect only when y is activated in `Axes`; isotropic mode does not use `y_range` separately. Typical values match `x_range`: ±1–2% elastic, ±3–5% anharmonic, and ≥±6% requires caution about unphysical bond lengths."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:68
#: b740f3d94a6c45a4abb744e468cf6d66
msgid "Z 轴范围（z_range）"
msgstr "z_range"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:70
#: 35786f317d7440f0901af381214a647d
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(-5.0, 5.0, 1.0)`。同上，只作用于 z 轴。"
"isotropic 模式不单独看 z_range。典型参考值同上：±1~2% 弹性区，±3~5% 非谐区，"
"±6%+ 注意抽查最近邻距离。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`, default `(-5.0, 5.0, 1.0)`. Same syntax and "
"guidance as `x_range`, applied to z. Isotropic mode does not use it "
"separately."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:72
#: 0cc87e36663744f9b3e4ccfd10e7cb1f
msgid "识别有机分子（identify_organic）"
msgstr "identify_organic"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:74
#: f6b106b1ffbc497da7f91303f6655dc8
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 `false`。分子晶体、MOF、有机半导体这几种场景必须打开——打开后程序"
"会识别有机分子团簇，晶格应变只作用在分子间，分子内部的键长尽量保持刚性。纯无"
"机晶体关着就行，开了反而多算一堆团簇检测。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. Enable for molecular crystals, MOFs, and organic "
"semiconductors. The card identifies molecular clusters and keeps "
"intramolecular bonds approximately rigid while straining intermolecular "
"geometry. Leave it disabled for purely inorganic crystals."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:76
#: 31b9e461b83b422b96f6496b5eab8979
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:78
#: 53ed2c75343c41c2bd0c334e089856a9
msgid "近平衡弹性（isotropic ±1%，适合补体模量）"
msgstr "Near-equilibrium elasticity (isotropic ±1%, suitable for bulk modulus)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:79
#: 238fd2eb5e8c4605be4811b10bd29316
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"CellStrainCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"organic\": false,\n"
"  \"engine_type\": \"isotropic\",\n"
"  \"x_range\": [-1, 1, 1],\n"
"  \"y_range\": [-1, 1, 1],\n"
"  \"z_range\": [-1, 1, 1]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:91
#: 403d985bebf844f4a2fdcb4715dcb8af
msgid "各向异性弹性（uniaxial ±3%，三个方向各 7 个点）"
msgstr "Anisotropic elasticity (uniaxial ±3%, seven points per direction)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:92
#: 4280d8ba689e4041b8d64412047e215f
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"CellStrainCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"organic\": false,\n"
"  \"engine_type\": \"uniaxial\",\n"
"  \"x_range\": [-3, 3, 1],\n"
"  \"y_range\": [-3, 3, 1],\n"
"  \"z_range\": [-3, 3, 1]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:104
#: 2931d82dfc2444e48a8974771e3de5cd
msgid "全方向覆盖（biaxial ±6%，适合怀疑模型在大变形下崩溃）"
msgstr ""
"Broad directional coverage (biaxial ±6%, for diagnosing failure under large "
"deformation)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:105
#: 86ea28b7743b4e0d817bbb4d2f66369b
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"CellStrainCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"organic\": false,\n"
"  \"engine_type\": \"biaxial\",\n"
"  \"x_range\": [-6, 6, 2],\n"
"  \"y_range\": [-6, 6, 2],\n"
"  \"z_range\": [-6, 6, 2]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:117
#: 84058226b14c4f20a6fc087e0ab210b0
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:119
#: 717e416c41104dd7ae23bc5f491ba7ef
msgid ""
"`Lattice Strain` → `Atomic Perturb`：应变 + 坐标噪声，同时覆盖几何变形和热扰"
"动"
msgstr ""
"`Lattice Strain` -> `Atomic Perturb`: combine cell deformation with "
"coordinate noise"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:120
#: 0a81c31415e14ffc9f948045b5bc2367
msgid "`Lattice Strain` → `Shear Matrix Strain`：先补轴向应变，再补剪切分量"
msgstr ""
"`Lattice Strain` -> `Shear Matrix Strain`: sample axial strains before shear "
"components"

